        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Greetins 47,\r\rYour targets today are Helen West, Herbert West, James Burton, and Lissy Ablington. All of whom are belived to be a part of a secret muffin society which is run by non-other than the Muffin Man himself. Our client want us to use this lead to trace down the Muffin Man and kill him. The Muffin Man screwed our clients wife 47, and now we must screw him back.\r\rGood Luck 47, and Happy Hunting.",
